pent with their soulmate when they were still here.\n(Open eyes version and closed eyes version)\n\nPlease feel free to choose the pose.\n\nIf possible, please also include a PSD with the character, background, and signature as separate layers.\n\nPlease look at this link for references\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1h1D0ujn0UdBY2S9sgFWgvlj-rIyUGyd8?usp=sharing\n\nThank you very much!\nI apologize if it's too detailed.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Aosugar_/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ca625891/uploads/origins/7c280011-9ca2-48fb-8bba-446981148a17?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e7220ef94b924a0e5709efd66ee1ffa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ca625891/uploads/origins/7c280011-9ca2-48fb-8bba-446981148a17?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e7220ef94b924a0e5709efd66ee1ffa, https://si.imgix.net/ca625891/uploads/origins/7c280011-9ca2-48fb-8bba-446981148a17?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e04e9016dede862ce8a4f1e38b24a54 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ca625891/uploads/origins/7c280011-9ca2-48fb-8bba-446981148a17?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c9b55a7f67e0ce53307777fef25474e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\nあおシュガーさんの絵を見て一目惚れました！！\n\n私のオリジナルキャラクターをお願いしたいです\nロマンスファンタジー世界観の子です\n\n表情は笑顔でその以外のポーズとか衣装などはお任せしたいです\n背景も出来れば花、木のような自然側にお願いします！\n\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cSkUuZESntsWG75phZpitofCny5bidHQ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Aosugar_/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ff229754/uploads/origins/ee2b5595-d2ac-4429-b5b9-6ceaa0849912?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=30766bed8f76e283314f2d60e310541c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ff229754/uploads/origins/ee2b5595-d2ac-4429-b5b9-6ceaa0849912?bg=%23fff